      "data": "#1=IFCPROJECT('0AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA',$,$,$,$,$,$,$,#2);#2=IFCUNITASSIGNMENT((#3));#3=IFCCONVERSIONBASEDUNIT(#4,.LENGTHUNIT.,'foot',#5);#4=IFCDIMENSIONALEXPONENTS(1,0,0,0,0,0,0);#5=IFCMEASUREWITHUNIT(IFCLENGTHMEASURE(12.),#6);#6=IFCCONVERSIONBASEDUNIT(#4,.LENGTHUNIT.,'inch',#7);#7=IFCMEASUREWITHUNIT(IFCLENGTHMEASURE(25.4),#8);#8=IFCSIUNIT(*,.LENGTHUNIT.,.MILLI.,.METRE.);",
